+## Board Publication
+
+Admins can publish a board to generate a secret public URL where anyone can view the board, its columns, and its published cards without signing in.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board. Only account admins can publish a board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board JSON including its `public_url`.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board, revoking its public URL. Only account admins can unpublish a board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
